{"id":"635672","name":"锅贴饼子","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/635672/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"150"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"2克"},{"name":"清水","amount":"120克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"玉米面粉。","img":"images/635672/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入面粉、酵母。","img":"images/635672/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/635672/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入清水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/635672/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上盖子，醒发20分钟。","img":"images/635672/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅内加适量清水烧开。","img":"images/635672/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把锅烧热，把玉米面整理成圆形。","img":"images/635672/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"全部贴好。","img":"images/635672/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上锅盖，小火烧10分钟。","img":"images/635672/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"关火焖3分钟。","img":"images/635672/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/635672/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煊软好吃。","img":"images/635672/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}